{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dreamcatcher </strong>is a proof of concept for a hand-drawn 2.5D adventure platformer where you explore a collection of floating islands as Kit, the Dreamcatcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains some basic resource gathering minigames, directional combat, a few NPCs to chat with, and a few things that need to be repaired around the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only takes around 15 minutes to experience everything, and can probably be completed in a few minutes if you know what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was an entirely solo project, and there are not immediate plans to work on a full game as of now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826190?t=1753271658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826190?t=1753271658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826190/496d513d2e39884e4ce2cb7807269ad013ed874d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753271658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826190/496d513d2e39884e4ce2cb7807269ad013ed874d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753271658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dreamcatcher </strong>is a proof of concept for a hand-drawn 2.5D adventure platformer where you explore a collection of floating islands as Kit, the Dreamcatcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains some basic resource gathering minigames, directional combat, a few NPCs to chat with, and a few things that need to be repaired around the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only takes around 15 minutes to experience everything, and can probably be completed in a few minutes if you know what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was an entirely solo project, and there are not immediate plans to work on a full game as of now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!</p>","developers":["WorkingOrders"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826190/a02ed0aeded0fa8365af13a48a69846d1b8d0fa4/header.jpg?t=1753271658","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Mint 22.1 Cinnamon<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel (R) Core i5-8400T CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Corporation CoffeeLake-S GT2 [UHD Graphics 630]<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 121 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> PCH [HDA Intel PCH], device 0: ALC233-VD Analog [ALC233 Analog]</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3826190/1580967086/3a8d2ca7451a711a0059c0ed391380f569848d02/1751030505/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751903099","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3826190/1580967086/3a8d2ca7451a711a0059c0ed391380f569848d02/1751030505/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751903099","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3826190/1580967086/3a8d2ca7451a711a0059c0ed391380f569848d02/1751030505/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751903099","id":257162403,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.s